## 2. API (заморожен)

```rust
#[derive(Debug, Clone, PartialEq, Eq)]
pub enum MarkdownNode {
    Text(String),
    Sequence(Vec<MarkdownNode>),
    Bold(Vec<MarkdownNode>),
    Underline(Vec<MarkdownNode>),
    Strike(Vec<MarkdownNode>),
    Italic(Vec<MarkdownNode>),
